{"surface": "event", "title": "Jensen Huang returns to Nvidia in a formal role by May 18, 2027", "html": "<div class=\"ev ws\"><div class=\"evh\"><h2 class=\"title\">Jensen Huang returns to Nvidia in a formal role by May 18, 2027</h2><p class=\"facts\"><span>Any time to May 18, 2027</span><span class=\"sep\">·</span><span class=\"src\">Known from Nvidia announcement or SEC filing</span></p><div class=\"hds\"><details class=\"hd\" data-k=\"definition\"><summary>Definition</summary><div class=\"hdb text\"><p>Nvidia announces by May 18, 2027 that Jensen Huang, who resigned as CEO on November 12, 2026, rejoins the company in a formal role: chief executive, another executive post, a board seat or a formal advisory role.</p></div></details><details class=\"hd\" data-k=\"notes\"><summary>Rationale</summary><div class=\"hdb\"><div class=\"note\" data-k=\"note:29\" data-note=\"note:29\"><div class=\"md\" data-md=\"Polymarket asks the same return (any formal role: executive, board or formal adviser) by March 31, 2027 and by December 31, 2027. May 18 falls between them; I read it at a constant daily hazard. The board said on Nov 17 it &#x27;does not intend to reinstate Jensen as CEO&#x27; and has hired a search firm, so nothing on the calendar concentrates the chance inside the window.\"><p>Polymarket asks the same return (any formal role: executive, board or formal adviser) by March 31, 2027 and by December 31, 2027. May 18 falls between them; I read it at a constant daily hazard. The board said on Nov 17 it &#x27;does not intend to reinstate Jensen as CEO&#x27; and has hired a search firm, so nothing on the calendar concentrates the chance inside the window.</p></div></div></div></details></div></div><div class=\"strip\" data-count=\"6\" style=\"--cols:5\"><div class=\"sf first\" data-k=\"fig:Forecast\"><span class=\"lab\">Forecast</span><span class=\"v\"><a class=\"go num\" data-go=\"x:p:prop:3\"><span class=\"n v\">14.9%</span></a></span><a class=\"cap go calc\" data-go=\"